   "title": "How to use",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "DUGco Film Finish\n\nPut it right after VAE Decode (or Load Video) and before Video Combine.\n\n500T = tungsten, more grain and glow. 250D = daylight, fine grain.\ngrain / halation / declarity multiply the preset.\n\nSave H.264 at CRF 12-14 or ProRes: low bitrate smears grain.\nGrade AFTER keying or comps, never on green-screen plates.\nLong clips in pieces: set frame_offset to each piece's first frame."
   ],
